WEBVTT

01:36.640 --> 01:38.039
Why just the two of you?

01:38.920 --> 01:39.920
Where is Jinzhao?

01:40.920 --> 01:42.200
Sister said she had no appetite,

01:42.440 --> 01:44.080
so she won't come over for dinner these two days.

01:48.680 --> 01:49.520
Well...

01:50.400 --> 01:51.680
In the future,

01:52.200 --> 01:53.600
it will get hot day by day.

01:56.400 --> 01:57.320
Or else,

01:57.720 --> 01:58.840
from tomorrow on,

01:59.440 --> 02:01.120
I have the maids in the kitchen deliver the meals

02:01.640 --> 02:02.880
to each room,

02:02.880 --> 02:05.640
so that you won't have to run around in the hot weather.

02:11.360 --> 02:12.080
Well...

02:13.280 --> 02:16.040
Yesterday, the Vice Crown Seneschal

02:16.240 --> 02:17.720
Mr. Mu came looking for me

02:18.200 --> 02:19.079
and asked about you.

02:21.960 --> 02:22.760
Me?

02:23.480 --> 02:24.640
Why did he ask about me?

02:26.440 --> 02:27.800
His words were somewhat vague,

02:27.800 --> 02:30.160
but I heard the meaning.

02:30.360 --> 02:33.880
He wanted to propose marriage to his eldest son.

02:35.720 --> 02:37.640
The eldest son of Mr. Mu...

02:39.720 --> 02:40.960
Mu Zhidi.

02:45.280 --> 02:46.520
In my opinion,

02:47.640 --> 02:49.680
this is a good marriage.

02:50.160 --> 02:52.200
The Mu family is a household steeped in literary tradition.

02:52.680 --> 02:54.880
Mr. Mu is a Hanlin Academy alumnus

02:54.880 --> 02:58.800
and currently serves as Fourth-Rank Vice Crown Seneschal.

02:59.880 --> 03:01.320
As a minister of the heir apparent,

03:02.040 --> 03:04.320
he has a boundless future ahead.

03:11.560 --> 03:12.400
Father...

03:13.360 --> 03:14.200
Father...

03:15.960 --> 03:17.560
I really don't want to marry Mr. Mu.

03:17.880 --> 03:18.600
What's wrong?

03:19.520 --> 03:22.320
What's wrong with the Mu family?

03:23.120 --> 03:24.560
It was Mu Zhidi.

03:25.440 --> 03:27.720
Have you seen Mu Zhidi?

03:28.200 --> 03:29.200
Not really.

03:30.200 --> 03:33.120
Does he have any defects?

03:34.440 --> 03:35.800
No.

03:36.360 --> 03:37.960
He was ugly.

03:38.400 --> 03:39.680
You didn't know

03:39.840 --> 03:40.400
that

03:41.440 --> 03:43.120
he is almost like a pillar.

03:43.640 --> 03:44.640
If I marry him,

03:44.640 --> 03:46.000
I will be laughed at by others.

03:49.720 --> 03:51.079
Like a pillar?

03:52.680 --> 03:53.960
Listen to yourself,

03:53.960 --> 03:55.079
what you said is too childish.

03:56.280 --> 03:59.079
That Mu Zhidi is the eldest son.

03:59.520 --> 04:01.520
Logically speaking, it was you who got the upper hand.

04:02.000 --> 04:03.040
However, they

04:03.040 --> 04:04.520
care not whether one is born of the legal wife or a concubine.

04:05.040 --> 04:06.320
Why do you still dislike

04:06.320 --> 04:07.280
someone who is not good-looking.

04:07.520 --> 04:08.240
That's really not good.

04:08.520 --> 04:09.840
I really don't want to marry him.

04:09.840 --> 04:10.600
Shut up.

04:11.160 --> 04:12.560
Don't say such words

04:13.000 --> 04:14.480
that judge people by their appearance anymore.

04:14.680 --> 04:16.320
You are simply ill-mannered.

04:17.360 --> 04:18.720
A great marriage relies on

04:19.200 --> 04:20.360
parental command and

04:20.600 --> 04:22.079
matchmaker's arrangement.

04:22.560 --> 04:24.360
There's no place for you to speak.

04:34.040 --> 04:34.800
You

04:34.800 --> 04:36.080
only care about family background,

04:36.320 --> 04:37.680
and never care about appearance or character.

04:38.280 --> 04:39.000
Mother,

04:39.360 --> 04:39.880
can you

04:39.880 --> 04:41.320
help me?

04:41.480 --> 04:42.400
I really don't want to marry

04:42.400 --> 04:43.840
that Mu Zhidi.

04:44.280 --> 04:45.520
Actually, I told your father

04:45.520 --> 04:47.159
about this,

04:47.480 --> 04:49.200
and let him listen to your opinion.

04:50.760 --> 04:51.920
But

04:52.960 --> 04:54.200
he still refused and

04:54.600 --> 04:55.720
let me not interfere in this matter.

04:57.080 --> 04:58.159
Mother,

04:58.320 --> 04:59.520
I beg you,

04:59.520 --> 05:01.360
please help me talk about it again.

05:02.160 --> 05:04.120
But your father won't say yes.

05:04.880 --> 05:06.760
But you're the mistress of the house.

05:07.280 --> 05:08.200
No matter what,

05:08.440 --> 05:10.520
I grew up in front of you.

05:10.920 --> 05:12.760
You can't just ignore, mother.

05:13.200 --> 05:14.520
I beg you, mother.

05:14.520 --> 05:15.960
Please help me talk again.

05:16.320 --> 05:17.240
Miss Gu,

05:17.760 --> 05:19.040
Madam Ji is weak.

05:19.200 --> 05:20.680
Can't stand you like this.

05:21.720 --> 05:24.120
Mother, I beg you.

05:24.120 --> 05:24.800
I...

05:26.880 --> 05:28.720
I can't help you either.

05:33.240 --> 05:34.120
Miss Gu,

05:34.360 --> 05:35.640
you go back first.

06:02.680 --> 06:03.680
I know that

06:04.280 --> 06:05.880
you just hold a grudge against my mother.

06:06.360 --> 06:07.880
That's why you didn't help me on purpose.

06:10.280 --> 06:11.920
What are you talking about?

06:12.200 --> 06:13.120
Madam Ji is tired.

06:13.120 --> 06:13.840
Please go back first.

06:13.840 --> 06:14.600
Don't touch me.

06:18.560 --> 06:19.360
Lan...

06:33.120 --> 06:33.840
Do you...

06:34.960 --> 06:36.600
Do you still want to stop me?

06:37.320 --> 06:38.200
Get out of the way.

06:52.040 --> 06:52.720
Mother,

06:53.680 --> 06:54.360
I...

06:57.760 --> 06:58.480
Lan...

06:59.560 --> 07:01.520
Nanny Zhou is dead.

07:02.800 --> 07:04.800
What should I do in the future?

07:04.800 --> 07:06.040
Lan...

07:11.640 --> 07:12.640
Lan...

07:19.960 --> 07:21.840
They said that after sending her to the village,

07:23.440 --> 07:25.000
she passed away in the middle of the night.

07:25.200 --> 07:26.280
Madam Ji ordered that

07:26.920 --> 07:28.320
don't give funeral expenses and

07:28.920 --> 07:30.520
throw her into mass graves.

07:31.920 --> 07:32.720
Lan,

07:33.920 --> 07:35.520
what should I do?

07:35.520 --> 07:37.680
She is Nanny Zhou.

07:38.280 --> 07:38.920
Mother,

07:39.800 --> 07:40.600
stop crying.

07:42.040 --> 07:43.680
I'll go to find the chief steward tomorrow.

07:44.480 --> 07:45.760
Let them buy a coffin

07:46.320 --> 07:47.240
to Nanny Zhou.

07:48.159 --> 07:49.440
Can they listen to you?

07:50.760 --> 07:52.080
They came to tell you.

07:52.800 --> 07:53.640
Just want you to

07:53.640 --> 07:55.680
beg them with the money.

07:59.040 --> 07:59.960
Right, right, right.

08:00.720 --> 08:02.120
You are smart.

08:03.920 --> 08:04.760
But Lan,

08:05.640 --> 08:07.000
you came to me so late.

08:07.560 --> 08:09.080
Has anyone bullied you?

08:11.000 --> 08:12.040
Bully?

08:16.280 --> 08:18.160
I won't let them bully me.

08:20.160 --> 08:21.000
They thought they

08:21.000 --> 08:22.520
wanted to control me

08:23.320 --> 08:25.080
with my marriage.

08:26.040 --> 08:26.920
Don't even think!

08:27.760 --> 08:28.840
Madam Ji Is making a fuss about

08:28.840 --> 08:29.760
your marriage.

08:30.680 --> 08:32.480
What is she trying to do?

08:34.559 --> 08:35.640
She can't do anything.

08:37.000 --> 08:37.760
Mother,

08:38.400 --> 08:39.720
before Nanny Zhou came to village,

08:40.360 --> 08:41.440
she told me one thing.

08:42.039 --> 08:43.000
She said that

08:43.559 --> 08:45.480
as long as this matter is uncovered...

08:47.000 --> 08:47.800
Right,

08:48.680 --> 08:49.720
there's something about it.

08:50.360 --> 08:53.360
You have to tell your mother.

09:03.280 --> 09:04.560
What's the matter? Tell me.

09:07.280 --> 09:08.800
Do you still remember Madam Yun?

09:09.080 --> 09:10.160
Madam Yun?

09:12.600 --> 09:14.760
You mean Yunxiang?

09:15.440 --> 09:16.600
Madam Ji, please have a tea.

09:25.560 --> 09:26.760
Of course I remember her.

09:27.480 --> 09:29.120
She is the Madam Ji's dowry maid.

09:29.520 --> 09:30.800
Madam Ji married her to your father

09:30.800 --> 09:31.840
as a housemaid.

09:32.240 --> 09:33.760
At seven months pregnant,

09:34.000 --> 09:35.320
she ingested oxytocin by mistake.

09:35.640 --> 09:36.520
One corpse, two lives.

09:37.480 --> 09:38.600
But why did Nanny Zhou

09:38.600 --> 09:39.640
tell you about this?

09:39.920 --> 09:41.880
Yuping, who served Yunxiang.

09:41.880 --> 09:42.760
back then, told her

09:43.560 --> 09:45.840
it was Madam Ji who killed Yunxiang.

09:47.400 --> 09:48.240
What?

09:53.000 --> 09:53.960
I decided.

09:54.480 --> 09:55.760
I want to find Yuping.

09:56.720 --> 09:57.400
Then,

09:58.560 --> 09:59.960
I can uncover what happened back then,

10:00.400 --> 10:01.800
so that father and Madam

10:02.320 --> 10:03.640
will have a fight.

10:04.960 --> 10:05.920
There will be a mess in the family.

10:06.560 --> 10:07.320
They won't have time to take care of

10:07.320 --> 10:08.560
my marriage.

10:09.280 --> 10:09.920
And

10:10.160 --> 10:11.160
once my father knows

10:11.160 --> 10:12.280
the truth of that year,

10:12.760 --> 10:14.040
he will hate Madam Ji.

10:15.040 --> 10:16.280
In that time,

10:17.360 --> 10:18.120
he might

10:18.120 --> 10:19.480
remember your goodness.

10:19.880 --> 10:21.800
Let's go back to the old days.

10:25.880 --> 10:26.680
Right.

10:28.560 --> 10:29.120
Lan,

10:29.440 --> 10:30.400
You're right, Lan.

10:31.080 --> 10:31.640
Right.

10:32.600 --> 10:33.160
Right.

10:37.240 --> 10:39.440
Thank you, Mr. Chen.

10:39.800 --> 10:42.200
Thank you for your support for our temple over the years.

10:42.640 --> 10:43.760
You're welcome.

10:44.160 --> 10:45.040
This is all

10:45.200 --> 10:46.200
what I should have done.

10:46.600 --> 10:47.560
But...

10:59.480 --> 11:00.920
Amitabha.

11:02.000 --> 11:03.720
I'll leave first.

11:03.960 --> 11:05.680
OK, please.

11:19.520 --> 11:20.280
Qingpu,

11:20.520 --> 11:21.920
there's a sachet seller in front,

11:22.000 --> 11:23.320
so you pick a few more for me.

11:23.600 --> 11:24.560
Okay.

11:36.040 --> 11:37.040
How are the matters

11:37.720 --> 11:38.880
at your home going?

11:48.920 --> 11:49.840
You want to persuade

11:50.400 --> 11:51.720
your parents to divorce.

11:52.400 --> 11:53.160
I know

11:53.160 --> 11:54.560
it is not a good reputation.

11:56.120 --> 11:57.000
But

11:57.000 --> 11:58.320
is fame more important than life?

11:59.280 --> 12:00.120
Things have come to

12:00.120 --> 12:01.120
this point.

12:01.280 --> 12:02.560
My father still

12:02.560 --> 12:03.800
still took Madam Song's side.

12:04.440 --> 12:05.800
It's so sad.

12:07.160 --> 12:08.680
Would your mother want to divorce?

12:10.080 --> 12:11.120
She was unwilling.

12:12.600 --> 12:13.400
I really don't know what the

12:13.400 --> 12:14.960
hell she was worried about.

12:15.440 --> 12:17.320
Someone may be for fame,

12:17.600 --> 12:19.480
but our Ji family will not.

12:20.120 --> 12:21.040
If my mother

12:21.040 --> 12:22.160
can divorce and go back to Tongzhou,

12:22.600 --> 12:23.440
my grandmother

12:23.560 --> 12:24.840
certainly won't make her difficult.

12:25.080 --> 12:26.320
It's too late to feel sorry for her.

12:28.520 --> 12:29.480
Or maybe

12:30.480 --> 12:31.440
your mother did not want to make

12:31.440 --> 12:32.760
Mrs. Ji feel distressed.

12:33.480 --> 12:34.640
Is that the case?

12:36.480 --> 12:37.800
I guessed randomly too.

12:39.120 --> 12:40.040
But,

12:40.480 --> 12:42.200
many people are soft on the outside and strong on the inside.

12:42.680 --> 12:44.120
The don't want to show

12:44.640 --> 12:45.960
their bad side

12:45.960 --> 12:47.440
to their relatives.

12:53.400 --> 12:54.720
But I'm afraid her body won't

12:54.720 --> 12:56.120
be able to endure it.

12:56.840 --> 12:57.680
The doctor said that she had

12:57.680 --> 12:58.920
been ill for a long time.

12:59.120 --> 13:00.040
Because rhubarb was

13:00.040 --> 13:01.080
found in the medicine.

13:01.520 --> 13:04.240
Because she's worried too much.

13:04.720 --> 13:05.920
Depression leads to illness.

13:09.560 --> 13:11.000
What happened in this house

13:11.320 --> 13:13.200
is more complicated and dangerous than doing business.

13:18.400 --> 13:19.280
Forget it, forget it.

13:19.640 --> 13:21.240
Why am I telling you all this?

13:24.320 --> 13:25.560
Why can't you say?

13:27.520 --> 13:29.800
Because you're a man.

13:30.600 --> 13:31.720
These disputes,

13:32.200 --> 13:33.040
you men

13:33.040 --> 13:34.160
don't understand.

13:35.200 --> 13:36.400
Why don't men understand?

13:38.640 --> 13:39.880
Because you men

13:40.040 --> 13:41.800
are the reason for these disputes.

13:42.600 --> 13:43.640
Not only the source,

13:43.640 --> 13:44.720
but also the prize.

13:45.000 --> 13:45.800
You think,

13:46.280 --> 13:47.560
Song and my mother

13:47.560 --> 13:48.800
had no grudge or enmity.

13:49.040 --> 13:49.840
They're fighting to

13:49.840 --> 13:50.560
the death now,

13:50.640 --> 13:51.280
because they were

13:51.280 --> 13:52.360
married to my father.

14:01.320 --> 14:02.080
Okay.

14:23.360 --> 14:24.720
May I show you somewhere?

14:39.080 --> 14:40.240
This place is really nice.

14:43.040 --> 14:44.520
Every time I encounter trouble,

14:44.720 --> 14:45.520
I'll always come here

14:45.520 --> 14:46.640
and stay for a while.

14:47.280 --> 14:48.240
You say that

14:48.360 --> 14:50.480
the clutter of things in the house

14:50.960 --> 14:52.960
is not conducive to your mother resting her body and mind.

14:53.120 --> 14:54.560
You can bring her

14:54.560 --> 14:55.680
here and stay for a while.

14:56.400 --> 14:58.800
You can also watch the mountains and listen to the springs every day.

14:59.520 --> 15:00.600
No outsiders to disturb.

15:01.040 --> 15:02.520
Perhaps after relaxing for a while,

15:02.760 --> 15:03.800
her mind will change.

15:05.200 --> 15:06.600
That's a good idea.

15:07.080 --> 15:08.480
But I'm worried that if mother

15:08.600 --> 15:10.160
knows this is your house,

15:10.560 --> 15:12.120
she will be uneasy.

15:14.720 --> 15:15.640
Makes sense.

15:19.320 --> 15:20.640
Then don't you say it's mine.

15:21.560 --> 15:22.440
Just say

15:23.040 --> 15:24.240
it's your friend's.

15:28.320 --> 15:29.080
Good.

15:30.840 --> 15:33.760
Then I won't be polite to you.

15:35.480 --> 15:36.160
Get up.

15:37.720 --> 15:38.840
You're welcome.

15:40.320 --> 15:41.640
His courtyard is near

15:41.640 --> 15:43.160
Baoxiang Temple.

15:43.400 --> 15:44.200
And it is

15:44.280 --> 15:46.200
elegant and quiet.

15:46.440 --> 15:47.560
Surrounding scenery is

15:47.760 --> 15:48.920
good.

15:49.200 --> 15:51.320
It was just right for you to recover from your illness.

15:55.600 --> 15:57.920
That would be too much trouble for others.

15:58.320 --> 15:59.160
No.

16:02.240 --> 16:04.880
He's a friend of my brother.

16:05.480 --> 16:06.760
He heard you are ill.

16:07.080 --> 16:08.240
Just take the initiative

16:08.480 --> 16:09.680
and let you live in.

16:12.000 --> 16:13.040
Right...

16:14.400 --> 16:15.240
Okay.

16:16.720 --> 16:19.000
Let's leave in two days.

16:19.200 --> 16:19.800
Good.

16:22.240 --> 16:24.600
Nanny and Molan are also going.

16:25.680 --> 16:27.080
That's good.

16:27.080 --> 16:28.000
I will go too.

16:29.080 --> 16:30.600
Then we have to pack up quickly.

16:31.000 --> 16:31.880
It is cold in the mountains.

16:32.240 --> 16:33.840
You have to bring warm clothes

16:34.760 --> 16:35.560
and

16:35.560 --> 16:36.960
what mother loves to eat.

16:38.120 --> 16:38.960
Where are you going?

16:39.120 --> 16:39.880
I'm gonna go too.

16:40.280 --> 16:41.600
No one said they would take you there.

16:43.600 --> 16:45.120
He is just like Cao Cao,

16:45.120 --> 16:46.960
and he can catch up with all kinds of good things.

16:47.400 --> 16:48.160
Yes.

16:48.320 --> 16:49.200
Everyone.

16:49.200 --> 16:49.960
You see.

17:44.240 --> 17:45.200
Yuping.

17:47.440 --> 17:48.520
Long time no see,

17:48.800 --> 17:49.600
Madam Song.

17:51.280 --> 17:52.400
Do you know what to say

17:52.880 --> 17:54.120
after seeing the master later?

17:54.520 --> 17:55.520
What else could there be?

17:56.080 --> 17:57.560
Just tell the truth.

18:10.840 --> 18:12.160
The tea is a little cold,

18:12.160 --> 18:13.040
so change the pot.

18:13.600 --> 18:14.720
Yes, master.

18:17.280 --> 18:18.120
Why is it you?

18:18.960 --> 18:19.600
Why can't it

18:19.960 --> 18:21.000
be me?

18:22.440 --> 18:24.360
Aren't you supposed to be grounded?

18:25.360 --> 18:26.440
Who let you out?

18:27.280 --> 18:28.160
Lan?

18:28.680 --> 18:29.560
No.

18:30.440 --> 18:31.360
It was me who secretly

18:31.360 --> 18:32.640
dressed up as a Nanny and

18:33.120 --> 18:34.200
sneaked out.

18:35.040 --> 18:35.840
If there is not one

18:35.840 --> 18:36.840
important matter that I need

18:36.840 --> 18:37.920
to talk to you face to face,

18:38.360 --> 18:39.720
I don't need to be so anxious.

18:40.320 --> 18:41.080
What's going on?

18:44.960 --> 18:45.600
Master,

18:46.960 --> 18:48.720
do you still remember Yunxiang?

18:54.760 --> 18:56.240
Why do you suddenly think of her?

18:56.800 --> 18:58.320
You're the one who hates her most.

18:58.760 --> 19:00.200
I naturally hated her back then.

19:02.000 --> 19:03.040
You love her so much.

19:03.960 --> 19:04.880
I'm not a god.

19:05.200 --> 19:06.280
How can I not be jealous?

19:10.560 --> 19:12.480
What's to be jealous of?

19:12.920 --> 19:13.920
She didn't have any children.

19:14.600 --> 19:15.800
Her blessing

19:16.440 --> 19:18.280
is much thinner than you.

19:19.720 --> 19:20.360
Okay.

19:21.000 --> 19:21.960
Don't say this.

19:23.600 --> 19:24.720
It

19:25.680 --> 19:27.480
makes me feel uncomfortable.

19:33.600 --> 19:34.360
What's going on?

19:35.000 --> 19:36.160
Ziling is Lan's servant girl.

19:36.640 --> 19:38.120
Her sister got married a few days ago,

19:38.360 --> 19:39.320
so she went back.

19:40.440 --> 19:42.080
She just happened to meet the girl

19:42.080 --> 19:43.440
who once served Yunxiang.

19:44.760 --> 19:46.120
I wonder if you still remember

19:46.920 --> 19:48.040
Yuping,

19:48.640 --> 19:49.520
she had talked to

19:49.520 --> 19:50.560
Ziling a lot.

19:50.960 --> 19:51.760
What did she say?

19:52.440 --> 19:53.480
She said she knew who changed

19:53.480 --> 19:55.120
Yunping's medicine back then.

19:55.360 --> 19:56.560
It killed Yunxiang and her child.

19:56.560 --> 19:57.360
One corpse, two lives.

20:12.720 --> 20:13.720
Yuping.

20:21.760 --> 20:22.720
Master.

20:23.400 --> 20:24.760
She was Yuping

20:24.760 --> 20:26.800
who was waiting beside Yunxiang back then.

20:32.560 --> 20:34.400
Yunxiang was born prematurely that year.

20:35.000 --> 20:35.960
You knew

20:35.960 --> 20:36.520
that it was because she had

20:36.520 --> 20:38.040
taken the decoction of oxytosis,

20:38.600 --> 20:39.400
but

20:40.640 --> 20:41.280
at that time,

20:41.280 --> 20:43.120
medicines for stabilizing the fetus and decoctions of oxytosis

20:43.440 --> 20:45.000
were kept in two cabinets.

20:45.800 --> 20:46.800
How could Cuiping

20:46.800 --> 20:47.840
be confused?

20:48.440 --> 20:49.280
At that time,

20:49.760 --> 20:51.040
apart from Cuiping and me,

20:51.040 --> 20:52.680
the only one who will go to Yunxiang's kitchen

20:53.040 --> 20:54.000
is

20:55.440 --> 20:56.720
Madam Ji.

20:57.400 --> 20:59.200
She is concerned about  Yunxiang's diet

20:59.440 --> 21:01.520
and often going to check how she is eating.

21:02.280 --> 21:03.520
Sometimes she goes in for a long time

21:03.840 --> 21:05.040
and never comes out.

21:05.880 --> 21:07.040
Cuiping's elder brother, who

21:07.040 --> 21:07.920
is away from home, is ill.

21:08.360 --> 21:09.960
It is Yunxiang paid for the treatment.

21:10.600 --> 21:11.760
Cuiping was loyal to

21:11.760 --> 21:12.720
Yunxiang.

21:12.880 --> 21:14.560
She won't harm Yunxiang.

21:16.520 --> 21:18.800
Since you can't make mistakes with decoctions

21:19.680 --> 21:20.560
and it wasn't Cuiping who deliberately

21:20.560 --> 21:21.720
confused.

21:22.280 --> 21:23.040
Then

21:25.320 --> 21:26.560
It is only

21:27.560 --> 21:28.760
Madam Ji changed it.

21:56.160 --> 21:56.880
This is

21:56.880 --> 21:57.800
a good choice.

21:58.000 --> 21:58.600
Good.

21:58.800 --> 22:00.800
Mother, you are too biased.

22:00.800 --> 22:01.760
You always help Jinzhao.

22:02.160 --> 22:03.880
Then I'll help you next time.

22:04.560 --> 22:06.120
But that's what you said last time.

22:09.720 --> 22:10.320
Okay.

22:12.760 --> 22:13.480
Okay, okay, okay.

22:16.120 --> 22:16.720
Father.

22:18.120 --> 22:18.920
Master.

22:43.240 --> 22:44.520
Why did you come suddenly?

22:44.960 --> 22:46.120
What a bummer.

23:01.480 --> 23:02.280
Master.

23:03.920 --> 23:04.680
Something happened?

23:11.040 --> 23:11.840
I ask you.

23:12.440 --> 23:15.880
Yunxiang died of dystocia in that year.

23:17.480 --> 23:20.040
Is it because of you

23:20.400 --> 23:21.920
change her medicine?

23:27.000 --> 23:28.040
What did you say?

23:28.600 --> 23:29.160
I...

23:29.560 --> 23:30.240
How?

23:31.320 --> 23:33.000
How do you bring this up?

23:33.600 --> 23:34.600
Yuping is here.

23:35.080 --> 23:36.000
Yuping?

23:38.080 --> 23:39.880
You can't even forget her, can you?

23:40.240 --> 23:44.200
You pointed her to Yunxiang.

23:44.200 --> 23:45.440
Of course I remember.

23:45.680 --> 23:47.360
She's my personal maid.

23:47.600 --> 23:48.360
What's wrong?

23:48.880 --> 23:49.960
Yuping said

23:51.360 --> 23:52.520
it was you back then

23:53.320 --> 23:54.760
secretly replaced

23:54.760 --> 23:58.240
Yunxiang's fetal medicine and oxytocin decoction

23:58.720 --> 24:01.960
which caused her sudden premature birth,

24:02.600 --> 24:04.240
blood collapse and death.

24:12.360 --> 24:14.160
I still remember

24:15.920 --> 24:16.680
that year,

24:17.680 --> 24:20.480
you see me in harmony with Miaohua,

24:20.880 --> 24:23.640
so you deliberately married Yunxiang to me.

24:25.000 --> 24:26.600
Yunxiang is a good person,

24:27.560 --> 24:28.800
gentle and honest,

24:28.800 --> 24:30.200
and I also accept your kindness.

24:31.280 --> 24:32.400
Unexpectedly,

24:33.560 --> 24:35.320
you actually have a heart of fear towards

24:35.320 --> 24:37.200
Yunxiang.

24:37.200 --> 24:39.080
One corpse, two lives. Ji Han!

24:39.200 --> 24:39.600
I...

24:39.600 --> 24:40.400
At least,

24:40.640 --> 24:42.200
she served you once.

24:42.360 --> 24:43.520
How can you

24:44.040 --> 24:45.640
doing such a vicious thing to her?

24:45.760 --> 24:47.000
Master,

24:47.240 --> 24:48.680
that's not true.

24:49.480 --> 24:50.840
I haven't harmed Yunxiang, I haven't.

24:50.840 --> 24:52.960
This is a slander.

24:53.160 --> 24:54.640
She is also your personal maid.

24:54.640 --> 24:55.800
Why should she slander you?

24:56.840 --> 24:57.640
Where's Yuping?

24:58.000 --> 24:58.800
You call her over.

24:59.120 --> 25:00.240
I confronted her face to face.

25:00.760 --> 25:01.800
What's there to confront?

25:02.360 --> 25:03.320
She has been dead

25:03.320 --> 25:04.320
for many years.

25:04.600 --> 25:06.280
All the evidence has long vanished.

25:06.680 --> 25:07.880
Naturally, you wouldn't admit it.

25:08.800 --> 25:09.680
Which murderer would admit

25:09.680 --> 25:10.960
to killing someone.

25:11.480 --> 25:13.360
Then you decide I'm the murderer.

25:13.640 --> 25:14.720
And you don't think about that

25:15.280 --> 25:16.800
Yuping has been gone for so many years

25:17.280 --> 25:18.920
and how did she come back at this time?

25:19.200 --> 25:21.040
And who told her to come back?

25:21.760 --> 25:22.280
Right.

25:23.600 --> 25:24.800
Who brought her back?

25:27.360 --> 25:28.240
Who?

25:32.160 --> 25:33.600
I don't have to hide it from you.

25:34.320 --> 25:36.440
It was Madam Song who found her.

25:43.000 --> 25:43.680
Qingpu.

25:44.000 --> 25:45.120
Hurry up and find

25:45.320 --> 25:46.400
Yuping.

25:46.680 --> 25:48.000
She must be quite old,

25:48.240 --> 25:49.200
around thirty,

25:49.600 --> 25:50.960
who worked as mother's personal maid.

25:51.120 --> 25:52.320
She shouldn't be in the house now.

25:52.640 --> 25:54.480
But find her anyway.

25:54.680 --> 25:55.360
Bring her here.

25:55.840 --> 25:57.160
Okay.

26:08.960 --> 26:10.480
Song Miaohua again.

26:13.920 --> 26:14.840
What are you laughing at?

26:18.400 --> 26:19.320
I laugh at you.

26:20.280 --> 26:22.920
You believe

26:23.240 --> 26:24.360
Song Miaohua's words.

26:25.520 --> 26:26.200
She just put rhubarb in

26:26.200 --> 26:27.840
my medicine.

26:28.320 --> 26:29.680
She wants me to die,

26:29.680 --> 26:32.760
and you believe her words.

26:32.920 --> 26:34.560
These are two different things.

26:35.360 --> 26:35.920
Yes.

26:36.400 --> 26:37.960
Song might not be nice to you,

26:38.200 --> 26:39.400
but Yuping's words

26:39.720 --> 26:41.120
may not be false.

26:41.440 --> 26:43.640
You've always disliked Yunxiang,

26:44.840 --> 26:46.960
when Rong was born,

26:47.280 --> 26:49.400
it was always brought by Yunxiang.

26:49.800 --> 26:51.480
You see Rong

26:51.800 --> 26:54.320
was very close to Yunxiang

26:54.320 --> 26:55.480
and was unhappy,

26:55.720 --> 26:56.720
so you punished her

26:57.200 --> 26:58.800
to go to the kitchen.

26:59.000 --> 27:01.400
It took months to get her back.

27:01.600 --> 27:04.320
Then you asked Yuping to raise Rong.

27:04.560 --> 27:06.640
Do you recognize what I said?

27:06.760 --> 27:07.440
As...

27:08.320 --> 27:10.040
As a mother,

27:10.560 --> 27:12.040
of course I don't want my children

27:12.280 --> 27:14.280
to be closer to others.

27:14.520 --> 27:15.440
At that time,

27:15.440 --> 27:16.800
Jinzhao was not with me.

27:17.040 --> 27:18.800
I only have Rong by my side.

27:19.640 --> 27:20.160
I...

27:21.600 --> 27:23.440
I certainly don't want my children

27:23.800 --> 27:25.040
to be closer to others.

27:25.280 --> 27:27.160
What's not understandable about this?

27:27.400 --> 27:28.360
What happened afterwards?

27:28.920 --> 27:30.400
You married Yunxiang to me.

27:31.080 --> 27:32.720
But after she became pregnant,

27:32.720 --> 27:34.400
you become jealous again.

27:35.320 --> 27:36.640
Every time I go with her.

27:37.160 --> 27:39.360
You have to make an excuse to call me away,

27:39.360 --> 27:40.920
one moment saying that you are sick,

27:40.920 --> 27:42.480
the other moment saying that Rong is sick.

27:42.640 --> 27:43.120
I...

27:43.120 --> 27:43.920
Because

27:44.320 --> 27:45.840
Yunxiang's father and mother

27:45.840 --> 27:46.840
are still in the Ji family,

27:47.240 --> 27:49.200
you warn her to stay in her place.

27:49.320 --> 27:50.680
Don't keep haunting me.

27:51.080 --> 27:52.560
You think I don't know.

27:53.320 --> 27:54.920
But it is obviously...

28:03.520 --> 28:04.720
I get it.

28:15.800 --> 28:17.000
I get it.

28:20.120 --> 28:20.800
Fundamentally,

28:22.040 --> 28:24.200
it's not because of Yuping's words.

28:25.720 --> 28:27.080
It wasn't because of Yuping's words

28:27.080 --> 28:28.240
that you doubted me.

28:29.880 --> 28:31.600
No wonder since then

28:33.120 --> 28:34.680
you start to distance yourself from me.

28:40.760 --> 28:42.720
Originally in your heart,

28:43.360 --> 28:44.720
you have long decided

28:45.800 --> 28:49.000
I'm the murderer of Yunxiang.

28:49.720 --> 28:50.360
Act.

28:51.160 --> 28:52.720
You keep acting.

28:53.800 --> 28:55.880
There is no excuse for adding guilt.

28:59.040 --> 28:59.720
Mother,

29:01.680 --> 29:02.840
what you said

29:03.280 --> 29:04.040
is nothing more than

29:04.040 --> 29:05.120
Yuping's words.

29:05.800 --> 29:06.480
Otherwise,

29:06.960 --> 29:07.480
it's all about

29:07.480 --> 29:09.000
the past.

29:10.320 --> 29:12.440
Now that you has decided

29:12.440 --> 29:13.520
that it was my mother who harmed someone,

29:13.880 --> 29:15.160
then I will ask you to show the evidence.

29:16.240 --> 29:17.000
Evidence?

29:18.360 --> 29:19.720
Even if there is evidence,

29:19.880 --> 29:20.800
could I still be able to

29:20.800 --> 29:22.040
send her to court

29:22.040 --> 29:23.640
for questioning?

29:24.120 --> 29:25.440
That's

29:25.440 --> 29:27.120
why she's so confident.

29:28.320 --> 29:29.160
Besides,

29:29.720 --> 29:30.880
about Yunxiang's death,

29:31.520 --> 29:33.240
your mother is the one

29:33.240 --> 29:34.200
who benefits the most.

29:34.200 --> 29:35.520
What evidence do you need?

29:36.600 --> 29:37.680
According to the master

29:38.280 --> 29:39.600
who benefits the most now?

29:40.040 --> 29:41.000
It's Song.

29:41.440 --> 29:42.520
Then I can also conclude

29:42.880 --> 29:44.560
it was Song who found Yuping

29:44.880 --> 29:45.960
deliberately frame my mother.

29:45.960 --> 29:46.520
You...

29:49.360 --> 29:51.240
You just don't know what it means?

29:54.880 --> 29:55.600
Mother.

30:13.680 --> 30:14.400
Miss Gu.

30:15.720 --> 30:16.640
How's it going?

30:18.000 --> 30:19.200
No messages.

30:19.640 --> 30:21.160
When I got to the front yard yesterday,

30:21.360 --> 30:22.000
Yuping has been gone for

30:22.000 --> 30:23.120
a quarter of an hour.

30:23.480 --> 30:24.880
I dare not go out at night.

30:25.320 --> 30:26.160
Early this morning,

30:26.160 --> 30:27.720
Mr. Luo sent people out to search for.

30:28.040 --> 30:29.120
We must find her.

30:29.400 --> 30:30.320
Otherwise,

30:30.320 --> 30:31.560
even if mother arrived at Shuntian Prefecture,

30:31.560 --> 30:32.560
she still couldn't explain it clearly.

30:33.600 --> 30:34.960
I'll go out and look for it later.

30:35.680 --> 30:36.400
Miss Gu.

30:38.040 --> 30:38.680
Slow down.

30:40.240 --> 30:40.880
Miss Gu,

30:41.000 --> 30:42.160
your mother said at dawn

30:42.160 --> 30:43.040
that she was going to see Madam Song.

30:43.120 --> 30:43.800
Nanny Zhao couldn't stop her

30:43.800 --> 30:44.720
and had already gone with her.

30:45.040 --> 30:46.040
Thinking of what you said,

30:46.040 --> 30:47.280
I have to tell you about everything.

30:48.640 --> 30:49.400
You're doing the right thing.

30:49.520 --> 30:50.520
I'll be right there.

30:58.000 --> 30:58.760
Miss Gu.

30:59.440 --> 31:00.160
Where's my mother?

31:00.960 --> 31:02.680
Inside. Don't let me in.

31:05.480 --> 31:07.480
I've always felt that I treat you well.

31:08.680 --> 31:10.120
Where are you dissatisfied?

31:10.920 --> 31:11.600
It has come to the point

31:11.600 --> 31:13.040
where you have to kill me.

31:13.320 --> 31:15.120
You put rhubarb in my medicine,

31:15.120 --> 31:17.000
and instructed Yuping to

31:17.000 --> 31:17.800
frame me.

31:19.880 --> 31:21.480
I didn't frame you.

31:24.120 --> 31:25.640
So do you really think

31:26.560 --> 31:28.160
I was the one who harmed Yunxiang?

31:31.400 --> 31:32.960
If I'm really jealous,

31:34.360 --> 31:35.960
I should have framed you.

31:35.960 --> 31:37.320
How could it be Yunxiang's turn?

31:37.680 --> 31:38.320
That's because you married Yunxiang to

31:38.320 --> 31:40.040
master.

31:41.160 --> 31:42.800
In the beginning, you wanted to take away master's affection for me,

31:43.480 --> 31:44.880
so you married your personal maidservant

31:44.880 --> 31:45.840
to the master.

31:46.440 --> 31:47.440
But you didn't expect

31:47.440 --> 31:48.800
that she was more favored than I was.

31:49.160 --> 31:49.960
And she was pregnant.

31:50.840 --> 31:52.280
Everyone in this house said

31:52.480 --> 31:54.000
she is pregnant with a boy.

31:54.480 --> 31:55.920
Master was very happy

31:56.520 --> 31:58.240
and visited her every day.

31:59.000 --> 32:00.480
How could you not hate being tricked

32:00.680 --> 32:01.560
by your own person?

32:02.880 --> 32:03.800
Besides...

32:08.920 --> 32:09.920
Besides what?

32:13.600 --> 32:14.480
Besides,

32:14.720 --> 32:16.440
I guess you can see it.

32:17.200 --> 32:19.040
Master really likes Yunxiang.

32:29.880 --> 32:31.760
Doesn't he really like you too?

32:39.320 --> 32:40.480
Maybe.

32:45.360 --> 32:47.240
But I'll always remember that day.

32:49.200 --> 32:50.280
I told him

32:50.720 --> 32:51.800
in order to marry him,

32:52.440 --> 32:53.960
I have written a blood letter

32:54.440 --> 32:56.160
and cut off contact with my parents.

32:56.560 --> 32:58.000
But guess what he said?

32:58.680 --> 32:59.760
He was in a hurry.

33:00.360 --> 33:02.080
He said he was going to send me back.

33:02.440 --> 33:03.880
He said that I had caused him to

33:04.080 --> 33:05.160
offend a high-ranking official

33:05.160 --> 33:06.320
of the fourth rank.

33:11.440 --> 33:12.920
But I can't go back.

33:16.960 --> 33:18.360
I can never go back.

33:20.360 --> 33:21.520
I'll tell him that

33:22.160 --> 33:23.320
I'm pregnant too.

33:25.160 --> 33:26.440
He just gave up.

33:29.120 --> 33:30.120
Do you think

33:31.320 --> 33:32.880
this is genuine affection?

33:42.680 --> 33:43.520
Right.

33:44.520 --> 33:45.640
He also told me

33:46.240 --> 33:47.200
if he hadn't

33:47.200 --> 33:48.200
been desperate

33:48.600 --> 33:50.040
and need the help of the Ji family,

33:50.320 --> 33:51.680
he won't marry you either.

33:53.040 --> 33:54.920
After I was kicked out of my parents' home,

33:55.280 --> 33:57.360
I became a dispensable person.

33:58.680 --> 33:59.880
But Yunxiang is different,

34:03.080 --> 34:04.800
the way the master looked at her

34:05.440 --> 34:07.200
is different from looking at us.

34:07.680 --> 34:09.320
That's really like, right?

34:20.719 --> 34:21.560
Jinzhao,

34:21.880 --> 34:22.679
I'm looking for my mother.

34:22.679 --> 34:23.159
Wait a minute.

34:24.639 --> 34:26.480
Do you know where Yuping is?

34:29.159 --> 34:30.000
Yuping?

34:31.880 --> 34:32.880
Who is Yuping?

34:34.080 --> 34:35.280
Your mother last night

34:35.400 --> 34:36.639
brought

34:36.639 --> 34:37.520
a maidservant named Yuping

34:37.600 --> 34:38.440
into the house

34:38.760 --> 34:40.000
and went to see the master together.

34:40.719 --> 34:42.120
Now Madam Song is grounded,

34:42.440 --> 34:43.400
and Nanny Zhou died too.

34:44.040 --> 34:44.960
You are the only one

34:45.520 --> 34:46.560
who can help her.

34:49.760 --> 34:50.679
Are you sure that

34:52.800 --> 34:54.360
you really don't know anything?

34:57.080 --> 34:58.320
So what if I know?

34:59.720 --> 35:00.360
Yes,

35:01.280 --> 35:02.480
I found Yuping.

35:03.040 --> 35:04.160
But so what?

35:05.160 --> 35:06.360
What's done in secret

35:06.760 --> 35:08.120
will come to light.

35:09.360 --> 35:10.000
Do you know

35:10.000 --> 35:10.920
what you're talking about?

35:11.040 --> 35:12.080
You let me go.

35:12.480 --> 35:13.160
Speak out.

35:13.800 --> 35:14.960
Why did you frame Madam Ji?

35:15.480 --> 35:16.880
I didn't frame her.

35:17.840 --> 35:19.680
Yuping said it clearly.

35:20.680 --> 35:21.320
In those days,

35:21.520 --> 35:23.120
Madam Ji Is jealous of Yunxiang,

35:23.320 --> 35:24.280
so she deliberately changed the medicine

35:24.560 --> 35:26.320
and caused the death of Yunxiang and her child.

35:26.600 --> 35:27.760
Do you dare to go to Shuntian Prefecture

35:27.760 --> 35:28.480
and say the same thing?

35:28.640 --> 35:29.520
I dare.

35:29.840 --> 35:31.400
Even when I arrived at the Imperial Main Hall,

35:31.400 --> 35:32.480
I would say the same.

35:35.120 --> 35:36.360
I didn't frame Madam Ji.

35:37.280 --> 35:38.760
She did it herself.

35:40.520 --> 35:41.200
She...

35:43.040 --> 35:44.440
You said she

35:45.160 --> 35:46.120
Who is she?

35:47.240 --> 35:49.040
Why don't you call her mother now?

35:50.120 --> 35:52.200
She was the one who didn't treat me like a daughter.

35:53.640 --> 35:54.520
Back then, the master wanted to marry

35:54.520 --> 35:55.600
you to the Liu family.

35:56.000 --> 35:57.240
She asked everywhere in a hurry.

35:57.440 --> 35:58.840
For fear that others will pick on you.

35:59.880 --> 36:01.280
Rong doesn't want to study,

36:01.560 --> 36:02.760
so she begged the master

36:03.000 --> 36:04.320
to let him learn how to do business.

36:04.680 --> 36:05.720
Only me.

36:06.840 --> 36:08.360
I begged her...

36:08.840 --> 36:10.640
begged her not to marry me to Mu Zhidi.

36:11.800 --> 36:13.520
I begged her on my knees.

36:13.960 --> 36:15.640
Did she pay any attention to me?

36:15.800 --> 36:17.400
Did she ask anyone about the Mu family?

36:17.880 --> 36:18.800
Not at all.

36:21.600 --> 36:22.880
Because of this,

36:24.000 --> 36:25.760
you go and find Yuping?

36:27.400 --> 36:28.440
When a court convicts someone,

36:28.440 --> 36:30.280
it still needs all the witnesses and physical evidence.

36:30.960 --> 36:31.880
Why did you

36:32.200 --> 36:33.320
convict her on

36:33.320 --> 36:34.280
one person's words?

36:37.080 --> 36:37.960
You said that Madam Ji didn't treat

36:37.960 --> 36:39.400
you as her own daughter.

36:41.240 --> 36:42.000
Have you ever,

36:42.000 --> 36:43.440
truly, treated her as your mother?

36:49.520 --> 36:50.920
Anyway, I have a clear conscience.

36:52.000 --> 36:53.440
Since you have a clear conscience,

36:53.800 --> 36:54.680
then you tell me

36:54.840 --> 36:55.680
where's Yuping?

36:56.560 --> 36:58.040
I want to confront her face to face.

37:01.120 --> 37:02.400
I don't know where she is?

37:02.760 --> 37:04.160
She said that she exposed Madam Ji,

37:04.400 --> 37:05.600
she would surely be retaliated against

37:06.520 --> 37:08.360
and dared not return to the original place.

37:09.840 --> 37:11.240
I don't know where she is?

38:35.040 --> 38:35.960
Mother,

38:41.080 --> 38:42.280
what did you and

38:42.280 --> 38:43.240
Madam Song say?

38:44.880 --> 38:46.040
It was some

38:46.800 --> 38:48.160
personal affairs at home.

38:49.680 --> 38:51.320
You, a girl who is not married,

38:51.800 --> 38:53.320
there's no need to know this.

38:54.520 --> 38:56.120
You've been busy for half a day,

38:56.640 --> 38:57.720
haven't eaten yet?

38:58.240 --> 38:59.480
I won't keep you.

39:01.720 --> 39:02.480
Mother,

39:03.560 --> 39:04.760
anyway,

39:05.160 --> 39:06.480
I'm all your daughter.

39:07.480 --> 39:08.480
You can tell me

39:08.840 --> 39:10.040
anything you have.

39:10.760 --> 39:12.040
No need to avoid.

39:31.400 --> 39:32.000
Madam Ji.

39:37.320 --> 39:38.600
I'll go and call the doctor right now.

39:40.440 --> 39:41.440
No need.

39:43.280 --> 39:44.960
I've been wanting to cough just now.

39:45.800 --> 39:48.480
I felt a little better

39:49.720 --> 39:51.000
after spitting out a mouthful of blood.

39:51.600 --> 39:52.840
But...

39:53.640 --> 39:55.200
Go grind ink for me.

39:55.560 --> 39:56.640
Quickly.

39:58.520 --> 39:59.160
Yes.

40:22.840 --> 40:24.120
Now you and I

40:24.360 --> 40:25.760
hold different hearts,

40:26.440 --> 40:28.040
unable to share one mind.

40:28.680 --> 40:30.360
We choose to part amicably,

40:30.960 --> 40:32.640
each returning to our own way.

41:11.440 --> 41:12.120
Master,

41:12.560 --> 41:13.720
someone who served Madam Ji

41:13.720 --> 41:14.880
sent a letter.

41:15.320 --> 41:16.120
Put it there.

42:04.000 --> 42:04.880
Master.

42:05.920 --> 42:06.600
Get out.

42:08.640 --> 42:09.800
You guys go out.

42:09.960 --> 42:10.960
Yes. Yes.

42:15.840 --> 42:18.160
You coughed on purpose to show me.

42:25.360 --> 42:27.160
Do you have anything to do with me?

42:31.320 --> 42:32.840
What does this mean?

42:37.800 --> 42:40.000
Of course I want to divorce you.

42:42.640 --> 42:43.720
I think your intention wasn't

42:43.720 --> 42:45.000
to divorce me.

42:45.800 --> 42:47.800
You are trying to use it as an excuse,

42:47.800 --> 42:49.720
and use it to threaten me.

42:50.240 --> 42:51.680
Do you want me to apologize to you?

42:54.520 --> 42:56.120
That's what you think.

42:57.160 --> 42:57.960
Look.

42:59.480 --> 43:01.680
You looked aggrieved again.

43:04.400 --> 43:05.920
You always do this.

43:06.320 --> 43:07.960
It was the same way back then.

43:08.840 --> 43:10.760
I didn't want to marry Miaohua,

43:11.040 --> 43:11.920
but you advised me

43:12.280 --> 43:14.480
and said you agreed to let her marry me.

43:15.200 --> 43:16.560
Yunxiang too.

43:17.000 --> 43:18.240
I never mentioned.

43:18.520 --> 43:19.640
It's all up to you.

43:19.960 --> 43:21.600
You let her marry me.

43:22.640 --> 43:23.880
Each time,

43:24.920 --> 43:25.760
you're the one

43:25.760 --> 43:27.920
who got the reputation of virtue first,

43:28.080 --> 43:28.840
then became the

43:28.840 --> 43:30.680
one who is wronged.

43:31.280 --> 43:33.360
You've got all the benefits.

43:37.800 --> 43:38.720
That year,

43:39.160 --> 43:40.680
you went to the Song family for a banquet

43:41.680 --> 43:43.000
and were caught

43:43.520 --> 43:45.280
having an affair with Song Miaohua.

43:46.560 --> 43:48.000
To cover up for you,

43:48.000 --> 43:50.160
I had no choice but to agree to her marrying you.

43:51.280 --> 43:52.560
As for Yunxiang,

43:54.400 --> 43:56.040
you've been interested in her.

43:57.120 --> 43:59.760
You two keep exchanging glances.

44:01.440 --> 44:03.120
Can't I see?

44:05.320 --> 44:07.320
I don't want a scandal at home,

44:09.120 --> 44:11.680
only then did I agree Yunxiang to marry you.

44:13.160 --> 44:15.320
I've done

44:15.840 --> 44:17.320
so much.

44:18.840 --> 44:20.040
In your heart,

44:21.720 --> 44:23.280
I just want

44:23.480 --> 44:24.520
a virtuous reputation.

44:25.000 --> 44:26.000
Well, what else?

44:27.400 --> 44:29.760
I've been alienating you all these years.

44:30.680 --> 44:32.320
Except because of Yunxiang's death,

44:33.000 --> 44:33.800
it's also

44:33.800 --> 44:35.000
your own temperament.

44:36.240 --> 44:38.200
Obviously you are a jealous woman,

44:38.720 --> 44:39.480
but you

44:39.480 --> 44:41.000
pretend to be very virtuous.

44:42.640 --> 44:43.320
You...

44:44.040 --> 44:45.000
You what?

44:45.600 --> 44:47.240
You still have the guts to call me.

44:48.960 --> 44:50.680
The inner quarters are in utter turmoil;

44:50.680 --> 44:52.000
the children are ignorant and idle.

44:52.280 --> 44:53.720
As a mistress,

44:53.720 --> 44:55.200
had you been even halfway competent,

44:55.200 --> 44:56.600
I won't blame you.

44:57.680 --> 44:59.400
Our love as a husband and wife is over.

45:00.240 --> 45:01.480
To tell you the truth,

45:02.000 --> 45:03.440
actually, several times

45:03.840 --> 45:06.280
I have even written a letter of repudiation.

45:06.640 --> 45:07.880
But in the end,

45:08.480 --> 45:10.200
I burned them all.

45:12.280 --> 45:13.640
It's not for you,

45:14.920 --> 45:16.480
but for children's

45:16.480 --> 45:17.760
future marriage.

45:21.720 --> 45:23.840
As long as you understand a bit of reason,

45:24.120 --> 45:24.840
don't bring up divorce again

45:25.160 --> 45:27.800
in the future.
